[{"client_msg_id":"3284aa45-c4be-413e-9c95-d27ccefb2a82","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"SEGVについてはメモリー破壊だから落ちないケースがあるかもしれない","ts":"1616474684.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XPaO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4E93CA91-FE73-4A78-AEA4-03528C4D0E6B","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc使ってるんでnodeのプロセスもバンバン残っちゃうので掃除がめんどいんでそろそろお腹いっぱい","ts":"1616473948.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Glmsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b20b2b49-1740-4a3b-a597-416b2052ca4a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕のセグフォの再現ケースだと、コマンドは表示されないので見えませんが `:` を入力して `\u0026lt;TAB\u0026gt;` キーで何かのコマンドを補完するとセグフォしました","ts":"1616473482.024900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uuN0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d67d116f-283e-4373-a9e1-968d8a5ea2ce","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ただセグフォだけ再現しなかった","ts":"1616471400.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zz8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e4a2d79-c561-4bcb-a424-8ef0045bef97","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そこは書いたのでコマンド表示されないところまでは再現したんですよね\n最小構成と普段使ってる設定にプラスしたやつ両方で同じだったという意味でした","ts":"1616471368.024300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NLg6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa136a63-aad9-4ad3-8987-3831627bf7c0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"デフォルト設定では再現しませんよ","ts":"1616471333.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uNzA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9d9c44d-87b4-4c5c-9ed2-07ede388bc23","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"弄ってないからでは","ts":"1616471326.023200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F45"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cebe7827-3621-4c1e-945d-eddffa620803","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そして `:q` でもちゃんとexit 0できる\n最小構成なんですけどどう違うんだろう","ts":"1616469293.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gUP=P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df7d9692-7fb6-422b-9e59-c150203ee8f4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Arch上でやってみたんですがセグフォはしないですね\nnowrapもdisplayも普段弄ってないのでノーダメっぽい","ts":"1616469039.021200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zx/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24a01dc4-40e5-4e1e-b947-558050a4fda1","type":"message","user":"UJV04G927","text":"私も、yaegassyさんと全く同じ条件再現しました（セグフォもしました\nちなみに、wsl上のubuntu 20.04","ts":"1616465184.020600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U2A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62fb5bdd-d358-4808-b44c-276d7c6964be","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"お、よかった（よくない","ts":"1616464629.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N9uG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba922622-29f8-4a21-8d04-7b1e7bd24946","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あー、セグフォもしました。コマンド叩け無い状態で無理やり叩こうとタイプしてエンターしたら。やった。再現","ts":"1616464583.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ge"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8987c871-c072-4088-881a-54ef7c7d7087","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Macでもおかしいことは再現しました。セグフォはしてはいないですが `:` してもコマンド叩け無いっす\n```set display=lastline\nset nowrap ```","ts":"1616464516.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jr+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7904a03-b98f-440a-89be-5c1e5180594a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あー、なんとなくおかしいですね","ts":"1616464404.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delet